  "notes": {
    "title": "Heroine Mastery and clearer skill descriptions",
    "summary": "Each heroine now earns her own Mastery, and skill descriptions are easier to scan. Arena routes have revised rewards, a wider boss pool and rare events you can spot during a run.",
    "changes": [
      "Mastery unlocks up to three saved winning builds, Collect, Normal offer controls and cosmetics for each heroine.",
      "Skill descriptions and upgrade reminders are shorter. Build Direction shows the themes your build has invested in, and skill details use matching theme chips.",
      "Lightning, Fire, Poison and Bleed have been reworked. Lightning can strike in salvos or chain between enemies, and Bleed stores damage in wounds that stronger physical hits can deepen.",
      "Bosses can appear across all five dungeon tiers and scale to their destination. Normal rewards follow actual level-ups, and the final Normal boss now drops loot.",
      "Rare events can appear between waves or tie a find to an enemy group. Reward popups keep their size while you inspect choices, and combat has new cues for skill hits, heals and buffs."
    ]
  }
}